        "notes": "Full 15-page manual extracted via PyMuPDF from https://www.amplesound.net/en/Main_Panel_Manual-AGSC.pdf. Key differences from Eclipse: (1) PH is separate keyswitch B-1 not velocity 127; (2) Slide Guitar replaces Tap at F#0; (3) String force uses G0-C1 not F#-1~B-1; (4) Position Assignment uses C#1 activation not G#0; (5) 12 FX sounds (adds Raking); (6) Sustain has 2 velocity layers not 5; (7) Playable range is E1-D5 (40-86) not C1-C5 (36-84)."
